{"id":"steam-1206850","steam":1206850,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Owata's Action ONLINE","summary":"『OWATA'S ACTION ONLINE』 is an online multiplayer 2D action FPS with super difficult.\r\nWith the help of other players, you may be able to clear the difficult stages that are too painful to clear by yourself.","about":"◆Overview\r\n『OWATA'S ACTION ONLINE』 is an online multiplayer 2D action FPS with super difficult.\r\nIn this game, the player \"Owata,\" who dies instantly if he takes damage even once, has to clear numerous stages!\r\nThere are a variety of bosses in each stage, and you must defeat them while avoiding their attacks!\r\nWith the help of other players, you may be able to clear the difficult stages that are too painful to clear by yourself.\r\n\r\n◆Super Brawl Mode\r\nIn Super Brawl mode, you can enjoy team and individual battles with other players.\r\nBe accurate in hitting where you aim and lead your wannabe to victory!\r\nRegular tournaments are held every year to test your skills!\r\nFight daily to become the strongest Owata!\r\n\r\n◆Boss Rush Mode\r\nThis mode features bosses that have appeared in stages and limited edition bosses.\r\nCooperate with your allies to clear bosses that are impossible to clear alone!\r\n\r\n◆Customization\r\nYou can change your outfit from a stylish pirate hat to cat ears. You'll be able to change your character's outfit from a stylish pirate hat to cat ears, and make them look as cool and cute as you like!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206850/library_600x900.jpg?t=1642527433","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206850/header.jpg?t=1642527433","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206850/library_hero.jpg?t=1642527433","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1206850/header.jpg?t=1642527433","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shar